        <el-select v-model="shockYear" size="small" style="width:100%"><el-option v-for="item in timeline" :key="item.year" :label="`${item.year} 年 · ${item.unmet_demand_tU} tU 缺口`" :value="item.year" /></el-select>
        <label>冲击幅度</label>
        <el-radio-group v-model="shockSize" size="small" class="shock-options"><el-radio-button :value="15">+15%</el-radio-button><el-radio-button :value="20">+20%</el-radio-button><el-radio-button :value="30">+30%</el-radio-button></el-radio-group>
        <label>策略口径</label>
        <el-select v-model="strategy" size="small" style="width:100%"><el-option label="基线 / 协同对照" value="compare" /><el-option label="基线采购" value="baseline" /><el-option label="协同调度" value="system" /></el-select>
        <div class="formula"><span>放大倍数</span><b>Var(层级订货) ÷ Var(终端需求)</b><small>用于判断波动是否沿上游放大</small></div>
        <div class="window-signal"><div><span>风险暴露</span><b>{{ formatPercent(currentWindow?.average_risk_exposure) }}</b></div><div><span>供给集中度</span><b>{{ formatDecimal(currentWindow?.supply_concentration_hhi) }}</b></div></div>
        <div class="rail-note"><i></i><div><b>为什么看这个指标？</b><p>库存覆盖和完成率说明结果，放大倍数解释结果为什么发生。</p></div></div>
      </aside>
      <main class="analysis-main">
        <section class="metric-grid"><article v-for="item in metrics" :key="item.label" class="metric-card"><span>{{ item.label }}</span><strong>{{ item.value }}</strong><small>{{ item.hint }}</small></article></section>
        <section class="panel chart-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="kicker">02 · 信号传导</span><h3>需求冲击如何向上游放大</h3></div><div class="chart-context"><b>{{ shockYear }} 年</b><span>需求 +{{ shockSize }}%</span></div></div><div ref="chartRef" class="trend-chart"></div><div class="chart-caption"><span>竖线：冲击发生</span><span>指数以冲击前水平 = 100 归一化</span></div></section>
        <section class="lower-grid">
          <article class="panel amplification-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="kicker">03 · 分层结果</span><h3>波动在各节点的放大</h3></div><span class="unit-note">越接近 1 越稳定</span></div><div class="amp-list"><div v-for="item in amplifications" :key="item.name" class="amp-row"><div class="amp-label"><span>{{ item.name }}</span><b>{{ item.value.toFixed(2) }}×</b></div><div class="amp-track"><i :style="{width:`${Math.min(item.value / 4 * 100,100)}%`,background:item.color}"></i></div><small>{{ item.detail }}</small></div></div><div class="chain-flow"><div class="chain-node demand-node"><small>需求源</small><b>核电需求</b></div><i>→</i><div class="chain-node"><small>一级响应</small><b>贸易商</b></div><i>→</i><div class="chain-node"><small>二级响应</small><b>转化节点</b></div><i>→</i><div class="chain-node supplier-node"><small>波动峰值</small><b>供给端</b></div></div></article>
