        </section>
        <section class="panel interpretation-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="kicker">05 · 机制解释</span><h3>系统把波动压在哪些环节</h3></div><el-tag type="success" effect="plain">协同策略</el-tag></div><div class="interpret-grid"><div v-for="item in interventions" :key="item.title" class="interpret-item"><span class="number">{{ item.no }}</span><div><b>{{ item.title }}</b><p>{{ item.text }}</p></div><strong>{{ item.result }}</strong></div></div></section>
        <section class="panel comparison-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="kicker">06 · 策略结论</span><h3>同一冲击下的方案对照</h3></div><span class="unit-note">固定 {{ shockYear }} 年窗口与 +{{ shockSize }}% 冲击</span></div><div class="comparison-table"><div class="comparison-row comparison-head"><span>观察项</span><span>基线采购</span><span>协同调度</span><span>改善</span></div><div v-for="row in comparisonRows" :key="row.label" class="comparison-row"><span><b>{{ row.label }}</b><small>{{ row.note }}</small></span><span>{{ row.baseline }}</span><span class="system-value">{{ row.system }}</span><strong>{{ row.delta }}</strong></div></div><div class="conclusion-callout"><span>结论</span><b>先平滑采购信号，再用库存和多源分配承接压力，才能同时降低上游波动与缺口风险。</b></div></section>
